@startuml BiblioTech - Conceptual Model
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho

enum Role {
  Admin
  Professor
  Student
}

class User {
  id : number
  email : string
  passwordHash : string
  role : Role
}

class Material {
  id : number
  title : string
  author : string
  subject : string <<optional>>
  year : number <<optional>>
  edition : string <<optional>>
  tags : string[] <<optional>>
  ownerId : number
  blobId : number
  createdAt : datetime
}

class FileBlob {
  id : number
  storageKey : string
  fileName : string
  mimeType : string
  sizeBytes : number
  contentHash : string <<informativo, no-unico>>
  createdAt : datetime
}

class AuthSession {
  token : string
  userId : number
  expiresAt : datetime
}

User "1" -- "*" Material : uploads (ownerId) <<cascade delete, DB FK (ADR-0005)>>
Material "1" -- "1" FileBlob : stores (blobId) <<cascade delete, app transaction (ADR-0005)>>
User "1" -- "*" AuthSession : holds <<transient VO, no persistido>>

note right of Material
  RST-005: PDF/EPUB <= 50MB
  BR-004 v0.4.0: cascada dura 1:1,
  duplicados permitidos (201)
  v0.3.0: category fuera; similar_resources derivado
  v0.4.0: FR-014/BR-007 eliminadas
end note

note right of FileBlob
  1:1 con Material, sin dueno propio,
  sin refCount, sin compartir.
  Nace y muere con su Material.
  v0.4.1: fileName (normalizado,
  v0.5.0) para Content-Disposition.
end note

note right of User
  BR-003: email/password
  validados (Validator)
  BR-004 v0.4.0: delete Professor
  borra materials + blobs
end note
@enduml
